          {
            "text": "If you use a multi-destination collage, compare per-cutout click-throughs by destination to see which products pull interest; the causal path from richer cutouts to more clicks is conditional on creative quality, and the documented trade-off is that more, larger cutouts (6+ recommended) give more interaction points but require clean-background imagery you must licence for every item.",
